{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52579","headline":"陪王都督登楼诗 · 宋之问","name":"陪王都督登楼诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晦日登楼望，江山一半天。\n（见宋乐史《太平寰宇记》卷一六二、王象之《舆地纪胜》卷一○三《静江府》）（按：《全唐诗》卷五三《桂州陪王都督晦日宴逍遥楼》首二句云：「晦节高楼望，山川一半春。\n」此录二句当即其异文。\n因其出处甚早，有五字不同，韵脚亦异，故另录出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}